desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "golang"
	title: "检测 Go crypto/sha1"
	title_zh: "检测 Go crypto/sha1"
	type: vuln
	level: medium
	rule_id: "source-go-sha1"
	risk: "weak-hash"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 sha1.New / sha1.Sum 调用。仅匹配实际哈希 API，不匹配 import "crypto/sha1"。

### 风险类型
weak-hash

### 影响
SHA-1 不抗碰撞，不应用于口令、签名或安全完整性校验。实现既有协议、必须协商服务端算法时，应人工确认为协议兼容而非本项目可替换的漏洞。

### 检测方式
源码模式正则匹配 sha1.New( 或 sha1.Sum( 调用。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
安全场景改用 crypto/sha256。协议兼容实现不要强行替换，以免无法互通。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://h.go": <<<POS
package main
import "crypto/sha1"
func d(b []byte) [20]byte { return sha1.Sum(b) }

POS
	"safefile://s.go": <<<NEG
package main
import "crypto/sha256"
func d(b []byte) [32]byte { return sha256.Sum256(b) }

NEG
	"safefile://import-only.go": <<<NEG
package main
import _ "crypto/sha1"
func d() {}

NEG
)

${*.go}.pattern_regex(/\bsha1\.(Sum|New)\s*\(/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "medium",
	title: "检测 Go crypto/sha1",
	title_zh: "检测 Go crypto/sha1",
	message: "检测 Go crypto/sha1",
	risk: "weak-hash",
}
